## Project header row (column-aligned, workbench)

- First row in workbench `<tbody>`; `wbProjectHdrRow` background (not sky area band).
- **Project** caption + **project name** (bold) → `colSpan={3}` (Incl. + Description + Source).
- **Default Elevate** → Elevate col; **Style** / **Colour** → cols 5–6 (`compactField`, `wbSelectRow`).
- Cols 7–10 (SKU–Unit price) empty.
- **Project subtotal / Final / Gen–PM–Cntr–Ass.Cntr** → cols 11–18 (same layout as area header totals); cols 19–20 empty.

## Area colours

- **Area header row:** `wbAreaHdrBand` — darker blue (`sky-100` / dark `sky-900/55`).
- **Object table** (column headers, lines, notes): `wbAreaObjectBand` — lighter blue (`sky-50` / dark `sky-950/30`).

## Area header row (column-aligned)

- Use **20 `<td>` cells** (same as object rows). **Outer border only** via `wbAreaHdrCellOutline*` (top/left/right/bottom on perimeter; no vertical rules between cells).
- Field placement: **Area** caption + **area name** (plain text, no link) → `colSpan={2}` (Incl. + Description); **Area m²** → col 3 (Source); **Elevate** → col 4; **Style override** → col 5 (Style); **Colour override** → col 6 (Colour); cols 7–10 empty; **subtotal / final / loads** → cols 11–18; cols 19–20 empty.
- Column header row (`thBaseWb`): uppercase + `pl-2.5`; project/area field labels use `wbHdrLabel` (same).
- Header dropdowns use `wbSelectRow` (column width), not `wbSelectTier` / wide colour.

## Area footer (notes / questions)

- Same section title style (`wbAreaSectionTitle`), full-width `textarea`, `rows={2}`, shared `wbAreaFieldTextarea`.
- Do not move back into area header unless asked.

## Object line notes

- Notes column: icon only (green empty / red has notes), hover `title` = note text, click = modal. Not an inline textarea in the row.
